# HANDOFF G1: the PDFs/DOCXs in this tree are IEEE papers, PhD theses, Intel
# and Xilinx application notes, and the professor's own handwritten notes. In
# the previous checkout they were committed to the baseline commit, which is
# why that repo can never be made public without rewriting history. This
# checkout was `git init`-ed fresh (2026-08-05) specifically so they are
# excluded from commit #1 onward and there is nothing to strip later.
#
# `git status --ignored` and `git ls-files '*.pdf'` are the two checks.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pdf
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
resources/

# Nebula competition material, supplied by the organisers (2026-08-05): two
